{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33591","headline":"过分水岭 · 许棠","name":"过分水岭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陇山高共鸟行齐，瞰险盘空甚蹑梯。\n云势崩腾时向背，水声呜咽若东西。\n风兼雨气吹人面，石带冰棱碍马蹄。\n此去秦川无别路，隔崖穷谷却难迷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33591.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33591","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}